</mxCell><mxCell id="m_jhp" value="&lt;b&gt;Jurnal Harian Produksi (JHP) (/jurnal-harian-produksi)&lt;/b&gt; [INTI PABRIK]&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;1. Penjadwalan (Target Shift):&lt;/b&gt; Pilih Bagian (Cetak, Finishing, Setting, QC, Gudang, Mesin, Teknisi), Shift (1/2/3), Operator, No SOPd, Target.&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;i&gt;*Tombol &#x27;Copy Jadwal&#x27;: salin susunan target kemarin.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;2. Input Realisasi Lapangan:&lt;/b&gt; Isi Jam Mulai, Selesai &amp;amp; Lembar Berhasil.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;3. Pencatatan Rijek:&lt;/b&gt; Lembar rusak afdruk setup &amp;amp; jalan, Inscheet, Kendala." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9.5;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dc2626;strokeWidth=2;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
